{"seq":3,"slug":"economy-health-monitoring","title":"游戏经济健康监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-analytics/live-ops/economy-health-monitoring","wordCount":1976,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"游戏经济健康监控\">游戏经济健康监控</h1><h2 id=\"为什么经济失衡是-慢性致死-的\">为什么经济失衡是&quot;慢性致死&quot;的</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/game-metrics-taxonomy\">指标体系</a>中的大多数指标是&quot;症状&quot;——DAU 下降、留存下跌、收入萎缩。而游戏经济的失衡往往是这些症状的<strong>深层根因</strong>之一。一个通货膨胀失控的游戏经济，其表现是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新玩家觉得&quot;追不上&quot;老玩家 → D7/D30 留存下降</li>\n<li>虚拟货币贬值导致 IAP 购买&quot;不划算&quot; → CVR 和 ARPPU 下降</li>\n<li>资源泛滥让游戏失去追求目标 → 参与度和 session 时长下降</li>\n<li>黑市/RMT（现实货币交易）滋生 → 公平性崩溃 → 付费用户流失</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经济问题的&quot;慢性&quot;特征让它极难被传统指标早期捕捉——当留存指标已经明显下跌时，经济体系往往已经失衡数周甚至数月。这正是专属经济监控的必要性所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏经济健康监控的关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>产出/消耗比（Faucet/Sink Ratio）</strong>：经济体系中资源流入与流出的比率，是通胀/通缩的直接指示器</li>\n<li><strong>通货膨胀率</strong>：虚拟货币购买力随时间的下降速率——通过追踪同一商品的有效价格变化来度量</li>\n<li><strong>货币流通速度（Velocity）</strong>：货币在经济体中流转的频率——反映经济活力和异常行为</li>\n<li><strong>基尼系数</strong>：衡量玩家间资源分配的公平性——过高意味着新人无望追赶</li>\n<li><strong>水龙头-水池-排水口模型</strong>：将虚拟经济抽象为流体系统，便于直觉理解产出源、存量和消耗去向</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"游戏经济的基本模型\">游戏经济的基本模型</h2><h3 id=\"水龙头-水池-排水口模型\">水龙头-水池-排水口模型</h3><p>游戏虚拟经济可以抽象为一个流体系统：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph faucet [水龙头: 产出源]&#10;        F1[任务奖励]&#10;        F2[战斗掉落]&#10;        F3[每日签到]&#10;        F4[活动发放]&#10;        F5[IAP 购买]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph pool [水池: 存量]&#10;        P1[玩家持有货币]&#10;        P2[仓库物品]&#10;        P3[未领取邮件]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph sink [排水口: 消耗]&#10;        D1[装备强化]&#10;        D2[抽卡/扭蛋]&#10;        D3[体力消耗]&#10;        D4[交易手续费]&#10;        D5[时间加速]&#10;    end&#10;    F1 --&gt; P1&#10;    F2 --&gt; P1&#10;    F3 --&gt; P1&#10;    F4 --&gt; P1&#10;    F5 --&gt; P1&#10;    P1 --&gt; D1&#10;    P1 --&gt; D2&#10;    P1 --&gt; D3&#10;    P1 --&gt; D4&#10;    P1 --&gt; D5\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph faucet [水龙头: 产出源]\n        F1[任务奖励]\n        F2[战斗掉落]\n        F3[每日签到]\n        F4[活动发放]\n        F5[IAP 购买]\n    end\n    subgraph pool [水池: 存量]\n        P1[玩家持有货币]\n        P2[仓库物品]\n        P3[未领取邮件]\n    end\n    subgraph sink [排水口: 消耗]\n        D1[装备强化]\n        D2[抽卡/扭蛋]\n        D3[体力消耗]\n        D4[交易手续费]\n        D5[时间加速]\n    end\n    F1 --&gt; P1\n    F2 --&gt; P1\n    F3 --&gt; P1\n    F4 --&gt; P1\n    F5 --&gt; P1\n    P1 --&gt; D1\n    P1 --&gt; D2\n    P1 --&gt; D3\n    P1 --&gt; D4\n    P1 --&gt; D5</pre><p><strong>核心等式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净流入</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>产出</mtext><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>消耗</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净流入} = \\sum \\text{产出} - \\sum \\text{消耗}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净流入</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产出</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消耗</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当净流入 &gt; 0 持续时间过长，就是通货膨胀；当消耗设计不足以吸收产出时，玩家货币余额不断累积，购买力下降，IAP 商品相对&quot;贬值&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"宏观经济指标\">宏观经济指标</h2><h3 id=\"通货膨胀率\">通货膨胀率</h3><p>游戏内通胀的度量方式——追踪虚拟货币的&quot;购买力&quot;变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 计算游戏内通胀率：同一商品的&quot;有效价格&quot;变化&#10;WITH weekly_economy AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    DATE_TRUNC(&#39;week&#39;, event_date) AS week,&#10;    SUM(currency_earned) AS total_faucet,&#10;    SUM(currency_spent) AS total_sink,&#10;    AVG(player_currency_balance) AS avg_balance,&#10;    -- 用核心消耗品的实际交易价格衡量购买力&#10;    AVG(CASE WHEN item_id = &#39;stamina_potion&#39; THEN trade_price END) AS potion_price&#10;  FROM economy_events&#10;  GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(&#39;week&#39;, event_date)&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  week,&#10;  total_faucet,&#10;  total_sink,&#10;  total_faucet - total_sink AS net_flow,&#10;  avg_balance,&#10;  potion_price,&#10;  (potion_price - LAG(potion_price) OVER (ORDER BY week))&#10;    / LAG(potion_price) OVER (ORDER BY week) * 100 AS inflation_rate_pct&#10;FROM weekly_economy&#10;ORDER BY week;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计算游戏内通胀率：同一商品的\"有效价格\"变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weekly_economy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currency_earned) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_faucet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currency_spent) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_sink,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(player_currency_balance) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 用核心消耗品的实际交易价格衡量购买力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'stamina_potion'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> potion_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> economy_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_faucet,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_sink,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_faucet </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_sink </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_flow,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  avg_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  potion_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (potion_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(potion_price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(potion_price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inflation_rate_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weekly_economy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> week</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通胀率（周）</th>\n<th>健康状态</th>\n<th>应对措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>-2% ~ +2%</td>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>维持现状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+2% ~ +5%</td>\n<td>轻度通胀</td>\n<td>增加消耗坑、减少产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+5% ~ +10%</td>\n<td>中度通胀</td>\n<td>紧急增加货币回收机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;+10%</td>\n<td>严重通胀</td>\n<td>运营介入：限制产出、推出大型消耗活动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"货币流通速度\">货币流通速度</h3><p>货币流通速度（Velocity of Money）衡量货币在经济体中流转的频率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>单位时间交易总额</mtext><mtext>货币存量（M2）</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\frac{\\text{单位时间交易总额}}{\\text{货币存量（M2）}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">货币存量（</span><span class=\"mord\">M2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单位时间交易总额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def compute_velocity(economy_data, period=&#39;weekly&#39;):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算货币流通速度&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    total_transactions = economy_data.groupby(period).transaction_amount.sum()&#10;    money_supply = economy_data.groupby(period).player_balance.sum().mean()&#10;&#10;    velocity = total_transactions / money_supply&#10;    return velocity\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_velocity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(economy_data, period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'weekly'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"计算货币流通速度\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_transactions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> economy_data.groupby(period).transaction_amount.sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    money_supply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> economy_data.groupby(period).player_balance.sum().mean()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    velocity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_transactions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> money_supply</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> velocity</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流通速度的解读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>V 上升</strong>：玩家活跃交易，经济有活力（但过快 → 可能有刷金/外挂）</li>\n<li><strong>V 下降</strong>：玩家囤积货币不消费（消耗坑吸引力不足）</li>\n<li><strong>V 突变</strong>：可能有漏洞被利用（复制 bug、无限刷取）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"基尼系数\">基尼系数</h3><p>衡量玩家间资源分配的公平性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\sum_{j=1}^{n}|x_i - x_j|}{2n^2\\bar{x}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3161em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6301em;\"><span style=\"top: